From 1f9bb2b4c55cdc7bd5de1ac7977f76afab101a97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 07:22:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] (feat): Add opt-in mixed-precision Triton router GEMM for
 MiMo prefill

Add an opt-in Triton router GEMM for large MiMo-V2.5-Pro prefill
- Triton kernel consumes BF16 activations and cached FP16 router weights,
  converts activation tiles to FP16 in registers, and preserves FP32 accumulation and output.
- Enable with SGLANG_MIMO_MIXED_ROUTER=1 for router batches with at least 2,048 tokens.

Signed-off-by: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
